# An antacid suspension: neutralisation stops when the acid runs out
# Excess sparingly soluble magnesium hydroxide remains. This is chemistry, not
# medical advice or a dose recommendation.
register lv2
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.01mol
measure v1 ph
add v1 Mg(OH)2 0.02mol
measure v1 ph
look v1
inspect v1
